      "body": "Fixes #42764\n\n`Qwen3CoderDetector._convert_param_value` turned the text `null` into `None` before reading the parameter schema, so a string argument whose value is `null` was dropped. A boolean value other than `true` or `false` was rewritten as `false`.\n\n`null` is now `None` only when the schema allows null (`type` includes `null`, an enum contains `null`, or `anyOf`/`oneOf` has a null branch). Other `null` text stays a string. An unrecognized boolean stays the raw string, matching the integer and number branches.\n\n`TestQwen3CoderDetector`: the new case plus the existing boolean and nullable `anyOf` cases, 4 passed.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37651553026](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37651553026)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37651552661](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37651552661)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37651553029](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37651553029)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
